WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:06.839
This next story is not the most important
story, but it's the epitome of the petulant

00:00:06.839 --> 00:00:10.110
child that is the president of the United
States.

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:13.400
There is this tradition and you know, I don't
care about tradition for the sake of tradition.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.010
There's a tradition where for the last 40
years, presidents will come back to the White

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:25.259
House during the next administration and their
portrait will be unveiled by the then president.

00:00:25.259 --> 00:00:30.769
NBC News is now reporting that Donald Trump
is refusing to do this for Barack Obama.

00:00:30.769 --> 00:00:32.480
And I have to tell you, it kind of makes sense.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:36.020
Donald Trump has spent the last couple of
weeks accusing Barack Obama of committing

00:00:36.020 --> 00:00:39.180
the greatest political crime in the history
of the United States.

00:00:39.180 --> 00:00:41.310
He's dubbed it Obama Gate.

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:42.310
It's totally bogus.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:43.520
It's nonexistent.

00:00:43.520 --> 00:00:48.430
But when you accuse a former president of
a crime, you're probably not also going to

00:00:48.430 --> 00:00:51.960
then invite them to the White House to unveil
a painting of them.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:55.580
Now, I don't care at all about formalities.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:58.800
I don't care about faux bipartisanship.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.550
But this is one of those things where you
just expect presidents will act in a certain

00:01:03.550 --> 00:01:04.900
way.

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:10.679
Here is Barack Obama welcoming George W. Bush
to the White House for his portrait unveiling.

00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:12.039
And I'm not normalizing Bush.

00:01:12.039 --> 00:01:13.759
I'm not rehabilitating Bush.

00:01:13.759 --> 00:01:14.759
Bush.

00:01:14.759 --> 00:01:18.840
The Iraq war was a disaster, but they were
able to be in the same room with each other.

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:20.280
Obama and Bush.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:25.179
Similarly, here's George W. Bush welcoming
Bill Clinton back to the White House for the

00:01:25.179 --> 00:01:26.929
unveiling of his portrait.

00:01:26.929 --> 00:01:32.819
And again, I don't care about these ceremonies
in a concrete sense.

00:01:32.819 --> 00:01:35.460
I recognize the signal it sends that listen.

00:01:35.460 --> 00:01:36.939
Republicans and Democrats.

00:01:36.939 --> 00:01:39.350
This is about elites versus the non elites.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.520
It's about neo liberals and non neo.

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:42.520
Look, I get it.

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:46.960
I understand that this is not about ceremony
because Trump is not saying let's do away

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:49.090
with this pointless waste of time.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:51.200
We're in a time of crisis.

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:54.060
A party about a portrait is in bad taste.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.280
That's not what Trump is doing.

00:01:55.280 --> 00:01:58.249
If he were doing that, I might actually respect
him for doing it.

00:01:58.249 --> 00:01:59.719
Trump just hates Obama.

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:01.459
Trump is threatened by Obama.

00:02:01.459 --> 00:02:06.359
Trump has spent much of his presidency trying
to either undo everything Barack Obama did

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:11.970
or take credit for the things Obama did that
he likes and wants to be praised for.

00:02:11.970 --> 00:02:15.739
And he has publicly accused Barack Obama of
being a criminal.

00:02:15.739 --> 00:02:16.910
So this is a farce.

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.819
This is not about breaking with tradition.

00:02:18.819 --> 00:02:20.379
It's about being a global laughingstock.

00:02:20.379 --> 00:02:25.730
This is about Trump being the ultimate trigger
arable snowflake while he pretends to be the

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:27.310
ultimate alpha male.

00:02:27.310 --> 00:02:31.700
And this is also about hypocrisy, because
Republicans have claimed for decades they

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:33.269
are all about tradition.

00:02:33.269 --> 00:02:36.090
They are about doing the things the way that
we used to do them.

00:02:36.090 --> 00:02:40.770
They are about returning to this vaguely described
prior way of life that they love.

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:46.530
Whether it's about norms and conventions and
tone or all of this other B.S., it does very

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:48.760
little to help people who are struggling to
feed their families.

00:02:48.760 --> 00:02:52.420
There is no doubt, but here's just a stupid
opportunity to do it.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:53.710
Just do the tradition.

00:02:53.710 --> 00:02:55.550
Do the tone that you claim to love.

00:02:55.550 --> 00:02:56.550
But no.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:00.219
Instead, Trump is publicly accusing Barack
Obama of the worst political crime in the

00:03:00.219 --> 00:03:01.569
history of the United States.

00:03:01.569 --> 00:03:06.629
Despite being unable to actually name what
that crime is because there was no such crime

00:03:06.629 --> 00:03:10.590
and he is not going to do this totally triggered
snowflake.

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:11.599
Pathetic.

00:03:11.599 --> 00:03:12.620
Embarrassing.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.159
The world continues to laugh.

00:03:14.159 --> 00:03:20.959
And this is what we've got for four more years
unless we all do what we need to do in November.

